        "rating_value": 5,
        "report": null,
        "review_body": "Their website was really easy to navigate, with good pics of the products, which I really appreciate as an older person with bad vision. The description of the products were very detailed and accurate. The delivery was fast and the packaging was outstanding. But what stood to me was the customer service. I was back and forth with emailing them several questions I had and wanted (a different clasp) something they did not offer as an option on their website. They were able to answer all of my questions and make it happen. My wife is very happy to say the least. Would definitely purchase from them again without hesitation.",
