        "owner_reply": "Finding the right pearls is important, especially when shopping online. We're glad our return policy gave you the confidence to shop comfortably and that your Hanadama pearls lived up to your expectations. It's also wonderful to know the nickel-free earring posts and fast delivery made a difference. Thank you for sharing such thoughtful feedback.",
